#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:80
#: e897b80e408b41678f4062c0f09bba98
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "遥控输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:82
#: 333bb5554f544dfe848e36872af8b03c
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the RX2 (UART2_RX) pin. It supports all RC "
"protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details for a "
"specific RC system. :ref:`SERIAL 2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` is set to "
"\"23\", by default, to enable this."
msgstr ""
"遥控输入配置在RX2（UART2_RX）引脚上，支持除PPM外的所有遥控协议。特定遥控系统的详细信息请参见 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。:ref:`SERIAL 2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 默认设置为「23」以启用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:84
#: 033b3a97f4664e0cab5b0b21919f7e45
msgid ""
"SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the RX2 pin but SBUS requires that the "
":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` be set to \"3\"."
msgstr ""
"SBUS/DSM/SRXL连接到RX2引脚，但SBUS需要将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` "
"设置为「3」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:86
#: 8eb0c3e138bb4368b13b0da29c2f7e9c
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to TX2 and :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>`"
" be set to \"7\"."
msgstr "FPort需要连接到TX2，并将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设置为「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:88
#: fed0cf0d8be9478ea1b35a46fc5ad1e5
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a TX2 connection, in addition to RX2, and automatically "
"provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""
"CRSF除RX2外还需要TX2连接，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设置为「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:90
#: 03ee1035be1a4086b4c9d777e5b5c8a7
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to TX2 and automatically provides telemetry.  "
"Set :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2需要连接到TX2并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设置为「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:92
#: 8fe5b2237c4742cdb096153f1f2e4aa3
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 都可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:95
#: 29272e0ce2cf497281f9096aa26b802a
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:97
#: f5d1d90e97e5483da1f8417331073d96
msgid ""
"The autopilot supports 5 PWM outputs. The first four outputs are directly "
"connected to the integrated ESC. The 5th is defaulted for NeoPixel LED use."
msgstr "飞控支持5路PWM输出。前四路直接连接至集成ESC，第5路默认用于NeoPixel LED。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:99
#: 17d9172aaa00439b91f6c757914873fc
msgid "The PWM are in 2 groups: 1-4, and 5"
msgstr "PWM分为2组：1-4组和5组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:101
#: 832c4cd8de6147bba5aef776b01646e6
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate and "
"protocol. If any channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the "
"group need to use DShot. Outputs 1-4 support bidirectional DShot."
msgstr ""
"同一组内的通道必须使用相同的输出频率和协议。若某组内任一通道使用DShot，则该组所有通道均须使用DShot。输出1-4支持双向DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:105
#: 000c615634254b5ca56ce5a7fce5a25f
msgid ""
"for users migrating from BetaflightX quads, the first four outputs M1-M4 "
"have been configured for use with existing motor wiring using these default "
"parameters:"
msgstr "对于从BetaflightX机架迁移的用户，前四路输出M1-M4已配置为使用现有电机接线，默认参数如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:107
#: 52a9622b5ca2479c8684ef3f77316009
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1 (Quad)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1（四旋翼）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:108
#: 4251195e3816423b9a16cf395d31f1ce
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12 (BetaFlightX)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12（BetaFlightX）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:112
#: d64a91a1f2594cae8e18b30f10c25b0e
msgid "Integrated ESC Setup"
msgstr "集成ESC设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:114
#: 0c8e039ce5b344c2b3eb4151ee66ae5e
msgid ""
"By default the following parameters are setup for a Copter vehicle to give "
"Bi-Directional DShot600 protocol and BLHeli Passthrough capability to the "
"first four outputs which drive the ESC:"
msgstr "默认情况下，以下参数已为Copter机型配置好，为前四路驱动ESC的输出启用双向DShot600协议和BLHeli直通功能："

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:116
#: 4279e9072d4b413c87cf668de7b70540
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO_BLH_BDMASK<SERVO_BLH_BDMASK>` =  15 (outputs 1-4 are bi-"
"directional BLHeli)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO_BLH_BDMASK<SERVO_BLH_BDMASK>` = 15（输出1-4为双向BLHeli）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:117
#: a0b7ad75f57f41d1a29eb119549cc40b
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO_BLH_AUTO<SERVO_BLH_AUTO>` =  1 (enable automatically enabling "
"BLHeli passthrough on outputs 1 -4)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO_BLH_AUTO<SERVO_BLH_AUTO>` = 1（自动启用输出1-4的BLHeli直通）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:118
#: 6f64e23af32a4e839e92296a015f937c
msgid ":ref:`MOT_PWM_TYPE<MOT_PWM_TYPE>` = 6 (set DShot 600 protocol)"
msgstr ":ref:`MOT_PWM_TYPE<MOT_PWM_TYPE>` = 6（设置DShot 600协议）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:120
#: 0c2f995bab984630bb477e4e69ca9795
msgid ""
"for QuadPlane Copter Tailsitters, set :ref:`Q_M_PWM_TYPE<Q_M_PWM_TYPE>` = 6,"
" since :ref:`MOT_PWM_TYPE<MOT_PWM_TYPE>` only applies to Copters."
msgstr ""
"对于QuadPlane Copter尾坐式，需设置 :ref:`Q_M_PWM_TYPE<Q_M_PWM_TYPE>` = 6，因为 "
":ref:`MOT_PWM_TYPE<MOT_PWM_TYPE>` 仅适用于Copter。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:123
#: 12fdba9b3a6045aba7f775cbef78a3ec
msgid "Neopixel Output"
msgstr "Neopixel输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:125
#: d95eb85340b848af9cdff13946178c37
msgid ""
"The LED pin is PWM output 5 on pad and is default setup for use with a "
"NeoPixel 4 led string for notifications."
msgstr "LED引脚为焊盘上的PWM输出5，默认配置用于连接4颗NeoPixel LED灯串进行状态通知。"

