#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:140
#: 32105d1328504e2f8c2d2df4de14a511
msgid ""
"These are set by default in the firmware and shouldn't need to be adjusted."
msgstr "这些参数在固件中已默认设置，通常无需调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:143
#: d466d443d9a449a7ba38ae784d0ac340
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:145
#: de5688629bb54b9a90d057be796a3788
msgid ""
"The ReaperF745v2 does not have a builtin compass, but you can attach an "
"external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "ReaperF745v2没有内置罗盘，但可通过SDA和SCL焊盘的I2C连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:148
#: 886a1408429c491f8aee639e940fbbd0
msgid "Barometer"
msgstr "气压计"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:150
#: 6ce9bfc0e94542cabb7b85e127b7f224
msgid ""
"The ReaperF745v2 does not have a builtin barometer, but you can attach an "
"external barometer using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads or use GPS as the EKF3 "
"Z source. The board will boot without either, but only non altitude "
"information requiring modes can be used."
msgstr ""
"ReaperF745v2没有内置气压计，但可通过SDA和SCL焊盘的I2C连接外部气压计，或使用GPS作为EKF3高度数据源。飞控板没有气压计也能启动，但只能使用不需要高度信息的飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:153
#: 09461ce388db4b52983c532ad5164607
msgid "Loading ArduPilot onto the board"
msgstr "将ArduPilot加载到飞控板"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:155
#: a0fb865479404452938376583dcb78ea
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr "初始固件加载可通过按住引导程序按钮插入USB以DFU方式完成。然后使用您喜欢的DFU加载工具加载「with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:159
#: 1fe79f3126d94850a160be63e1b38e94
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the "
"xxxxxxxxxx.apj firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可使用任意ArduPilot地面站软件更新固件。更新应使用xxxxxxxxxx.apj固件文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:163
#: 84ecdf62975a49698a8c711be4888a1e
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-foxeerf745aio.rst:165
#: b0afc06563454032b70a42bf4d3a28e3
msgid ""
